This image contains FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), installed from the Alpine Linux
package repository (package "ffmpeg"). WaveMP runs ffmpeg and ffprobe as separate
processes and does not link against the FFmpeg libraries.

FFmpeg is licensed under the GNU LGPL version 2.1 or later. The Alpine build
enables GPL components and is therefore licensed under the GNU GPL version 2 or
later (Alpine license metadata: "GPL-2.0-or-later AND LGPL-2.1-or-later").

Files in this directory:
- COPYING.GPLv2, COPYING.LGPLv2.1, LICENSE.md: license texts from the FFmpeg
  source repository
- VERSION: exact version and build configuration of the installed ffmpeg

The corresponding source code is available from the FFmpeg project
(https://ffmpeg.org/download.html) and from the Alpine Linux aports repository
(https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports, package "community/ffmpeg").
